Terraform automatically creates resources in the required order based on dependencies. When one resource references another resource, 
Terraform understands the dependency automatically. If Terraform cannot identify the dependency, we can use depends_on to explicitly define it.

Reference another resource → Terraform automatically understands the order.
→ Implicit dependency
Use depends_on → We manually tell Terraform the order.
→ Explicit dependency
